---
import PolicyLayout from '~/layouts/PolicyLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '~/config/site';
---

<PolicyLayout
  title="Contact Formatoza"
  description="Contact the Formatoza team about bugs, conversion problems, privacy questions, advertising or suggestions for new converters."
  path="/contact/"
  h1="Contact us"
  lead="We read every message. Email is the best way to reach us."
>
  <p class="!text-lg">
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>
  </p>
  <h2>Reporting a conversion problem</h2>
  <p>To help us reproduce it, please include:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>the converter's address (for example <code>/heic-to-jpg/</code>);</li>
    <li>your browser and version, and your device or operating system;</li>
    <li>what you expected and what happened, including any message the tool showed;</li>
    <li>if possible, a small sample file that shows the problem — only if it contains nothing private.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Because conversions run in your browser, we never see your files. Please don't send us sensitive documents; a description or a harmless
    sample is enough.
  </p>
  <h2>Suggesting a converter</h2>
  <p>Tell us which formats you need to convert and what you'll use the result for. Requests help us decide what to build next.</p>
  <h2>Privacy requests</h2>
  <p>
    For questions about personal data or to exercise your rights, email us with “Privacy” in the subject line. See the
    <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> for details.
  </p>
</PolicyLayout>
